#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:178
msgid ":icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Rename`"
msgstr ":icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Переименовать`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:179
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-info-circle` :guilabel:`Info & tags`: View the "
