"части экрана приложения появится зеленая кнопка с "
"надписью :guilabel:`Подключено`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/devices_integrations.rst:185
msgid "Linphone account setup, registration successful."
msgstr "Настройка учетной записи Linphone, регистрация выполнена успешно."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/devices_integrations.rst:190
msgid ""
"Linphone makes a variety of applications for mobile and desktop devices in "
