#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:185
msgid "To require signer authentication via itsme®:"
msgstr "Чтобы потребовать аутентификацию подписанта через itsme®:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:189
msgid ""
"In the pop-up, select :guilabel:`Via itsme®` "
