#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:186
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_pivot_table.rst:248
msgid ""
"Open the relevant Odoo spreadsheet from the **Documents** app "
"or :ref:`create a new blank spreadsheet <spreadsheet/get-started/create-"
