"Откройте соответствующую электронную таблицу Odoo из приложения "
"**Документы** или :ref:`создайте новую пустую электронную таблицу "
"<spreadsheet/get-started/create-spreadsheet>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:188
msgid ""
"Click :menuselection:`Insert -->` :icon:`oi-view-list` :menuselection:`Odoo "
"list` from the menu bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:190
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`New Odoo list` panel at the right of the sheet, select "
"the :guilabel:`Model` from which data should be retrieved, then "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:195
msgid ""
"The default list for the model is inserted into a new sheet in the "
"spreadsheet. The sheet name in the bottom bar shows the model name followed "
"by the :ref:`list ID <spreadsheet/insert-list/properties-id>`, e.g., *Sales "
"Order (List #1)*. A panel on the right side of the spreadsheet shows "
"the :ref:`properties of the list <spreadsheet/insert-list/properties>`."
