"listu; název listu je :ref:`ID kontingenční tabulky <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/properties-id>`, např. *Pivot #2*. Ve výchozím nastavení je "
"kontingenční tabulka :ref:`dynamickou kontingenční tabulkou <spreadsheet/"
"insert-pivot-table/static-vs-dynamic>`, kde levá horní buňka "
"obsahuje :ref:`funkci pole specifickou pro Odoo <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-"
"table/dynamic-function>`, která načítá data z rozsahu dat, jakmile "
"jsou :ref:`přidány sloupce, řádky a míry <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/build-"
"manipulate>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:84
msgid "Pivot table properties"
msgstr "Свойства сводной таблицы"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:86
msgid ""
"When a pivot table is inserted into an Odoo spreadsheet, a properties panel "
"opens to the right of the spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"Při vložení kontingenční tabulky do tabulky Odoo se vpravo od tabulky otevře "
"panel vlastností."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:89
msgid ""
"Here, it is possible to modify various aspects of the pivot table's "
"configuration and presentation via the :icon:`fa-"
"sliders` :ref:`Configuration <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties-"
"configuration>` and :icon:`fa-paint-brush` :ref:`Design <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/properties-design>` tabs respectively."
msgstr ""
"Здесь можно настроить различные параметры конфигурации и отображения сводной "
"таблицы на вкладках :icon:`fa-sliders` :ref:`Конфигурация <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/properties-configuration>` и :icon:`fa-paint-brush` :ref:`Дизайн "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties-design>` соответственно."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:97
msgid ""
"A pivot table's properties panel can be opened at any time via "
"the :guilabel:`Data` menu by clicking the relevant pivot table, as prefaced "
"by the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot)` icon, or by right-clicking "
"anywhere on the relevant pivot table and clicking :icon:`oi-view-"
"pivot` :guilabel:`See pivot properties`."
msgstr ""
"Panel vlastností kontingenční tabulky lze kdykoli otevřít prostřednictvím "
"nabídky :guilabel:`Data` kliknutím na příslušnou kontingenční tabulku, "
"označenou ikonou :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot)`, nebo kliknutím "
"pravým tlačítkem myši kdekoli na příslušnou kontingenční tabulku a kliknutím "
"na :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`Zobrazit vlastnosti kontingenční "
"tabulky`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:107
msgid ""
"Depending on how the pivot table has been inserted, the following properties "
"are shown, some of which can be edited:"
msgstr ""
"V závislosti na způsobu vložení kontingenční tabulky se zobrazují "
"následující vlastnosti, z nichž některé lze upravit:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:112
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pivot #`: the pivot table ID, which is used to identify the pivot "
"table for the lifetime of the spreadsheet. Pivot table IDs are assigned "
"sequentially as additional pivot tables are inserted into the spreadsheet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:115
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: the name of the pivot table. Edit the name if needed. Note "
"that editing the name in the pivot table properties does not modify the "
"sheet name, and vice versa."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Název`: název kontingenční tabulky. V případě potřeby upravte "
"název. Upozorňujeme, že úprava názvu ve vlastnostech kontingenční tabulky "
"neupravuje název listu a naopak."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:117
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Range`: for a pivot table created from a range of data, the range "
"used. Edit the range if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Rozsah`: pro kontingenční tabulku vytvořenou z rozsahu dat je "
"použitý rozsah. V případě potřeby upravte rozsah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Model`: for a pivot table referencing Odoo data that was inserted "
"from an Odoo pivot view or inserted directly from the spreadsheet, the model "
"from which the data is retrieved."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Model`: pro kontingenční tabulku odkazující na data Odoo, která "
"byla vložena ze zobrazení kontingenční tabulky Odoo nebo vložena přímo z "
"tabulky, model, ze kterého jsou data načítána."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:121
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Columns` and :guilabel:`Rows`: the :ref:`dimensions <spreadsheet/"
"pivot-tables/dimensions>` used to group or segment data."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Столбцы` и :guilabel:`Строки`: :ref:`измерения <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/dimensions>`, используемые для группировки или сегментации данных."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:123
msgid ""
":ref:`Measures: <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures>` what is being measured, "
"or analyzed, based on the selected dimensions."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Показатели: <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures>` то, что измеряется "
"или анализируется на основе выбранных измерений."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Domain`: for a pivot table referencing Odoo data that was "
"inserted from an Odoo pivot view or inserted directly from the spreadsheet, "
"the rules used to determine which Odoo records are shown. "
"Click :guilabel:`Edit domain` to add or edit rules."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Doména`: pro kontingenční tabulku odkazující na data Odoo, která "
"byla vložena ze zobrazení kontingenční tabulky Odoo nebo vložena přímo z "
"tabulky, pravidla používaná k určení, které záznamy Odoo se zobrazí. "
"Kliknutím na :guilabel:`Upravit doménu` přidáte nebo upravíte pravidla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:132
msgid ""
"To :ref:`prevent real-time updates <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/properties-"
"defer-updates>` while building or manipulating a pivot table, "
"enable :guilabel:`Defer updates`."
msgstr ""
"Чтобы :ref:`предотвратить обновления в реальном времени <spreadsheet/pivot-"
"tables/properties-defer-updates>` при построении или изменении сводной "
"таблицы, включите :guilabel:`Отложить обновления`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:135
msgid ""
"To duplicate or delete *the data source* of a pivot table, click "
"the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon at the top of the properties "
"panel, then :icon:`fa-clone` :guilabel:`Duplicate` or :icon:`fa-"
"trash` :guilabel:`Delete` as relevant."
msgstr ""
"Чтобы дублировать или удалить *источник данных* сводной таблицы, нажмите "
"значок :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(шестерёнка)` в верхней части панели "
"свойств, затем :icon:`fa-clone` :guilabel:`Дублировать` или :icon:`fa-"
"trash` :guilabel:`Удалить`, в зависимости от ситуации."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:140
msgid ""
"When referencing dynamic Odoo data in a pivot table and using :doc:`global "
"filters <global_filters>`, this domain is combined with the selected values "
"of the global filter before the data is loaded into the spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"Při odkazování na dynamická data Odoo v kontingenční tabulce a "
"používání :doc:`globálních filtrů <global_filters>` je tato doména "
"kombinována s vybranými hodnotami globálního filtru před načtením dat do "
"tabulky."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:145
msgid ":ref:`Duplicate a pivot table <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/duplicate>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Дублировать сводную таблицу <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/duplicate>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:146
msgid ":ref:`Delete a pivot table <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/delete>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Удалить сводную таблицу <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/delete>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:153
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Design` tab of the properties panel allows you to control the "
"display and style of the pivot table:"
msgstr ""
"Вкладка :guilabel:`Дизайн` панели свойств позволяет управлять отображением и "
"стилем сводной таблицы:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:156
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Display options`: define the maximum number of rows or columns to "
"show, or indicate if the totals, column titles, and/or measure titles are "
"shown. It is also possible to :ref:`flatten hierarchical data <spreadsheet/"
"pivot-tables/dimensions-add-flatten>` by enabling :guilabel:`Use tabular "
"form`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Параметры отображения`: задайте максимальное количество "
"отображаемых строк или столбцов либо укажите, показывать ли итоги, заголовки "
"столбцов и/или заголовки показателей. Также можно :ref:`выровнять "
"иерархические данные <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions-add-flatten>`, "
"включив опцию :guilabel:`Использовать табличную форму`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:162
msgid ""
"Many display options of a :ref:`dynamic pivot table <spreadsheet/insert-"
"pivot-table/static-vs-dynamic>` can also be controlled via the :ref:`pivot "
"table function <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/dynamic-function>`."
msgstr ""
"Многими параметрами отображения :ref:`динамической сводной таблицы "
"<spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/static-vs-dynamic>` можно также управлять с "
"помощью :ref:`функции сводной таблицы <spreadsheet/insert-pivot-table/"
"dynamic-function>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pivot table style`: use banded rows and/or banded columns, add a "
"filter, or change the appearance of the pivot table by selecting an "
"alternative style."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Стиль сводной таблицы`: используйте чередование строк и/или "
"чередование столбцов, добавьте фильтр или измените внешний вид сводной "
"таблицы, выбрав другой стиль."

